  // which the CPU applies BEFORE the ice cap. The bake stores the capped
  // colour P + (S - P)·w; the stippled one is P·f + (S - P·f)·w, so
  //   stippled = capped + (capped - S·w)·(f - 1)   (orbitalIceCapWeight's note)
